			"notes": "ImagineMoreFun 3.4.3 for Minecraft 26.2 / Fabric.\n\n### Seasonal rides\n- Identify Haunted Mansion Holiday and Guardians of the Galaxy: Monsters After Dark using ImagineFunUtils server ride-status IDs, preserving each version's independent lifetime count.\n- Avoid attributing ambiguous truncated sidebar names to the ordinary ride version.\n- Ride Plan and Strategy Hub select Monsters After Dark in October and Haunted Mansion Holiday from October 1 through January 15 inclusive, using local dates. Outside those windows they select the ordinary versions.\n- Local Ride Plan tasks accept either version within each ride family, including progress and active-task highlighting. Lifetime statistics remain separate. Server Daily Objectives are still governed by the server's completion rules.\n- Update unfinished local plan nodes without rewriting completed history or crediting historical companion rides.\n- Remove autograb support for both Guardians variants; Tower of Terror keeps its own region.\n\n### Compatibility\n- Support OpenAudioMC ownership handoff to MonkeyCraft mobile audio, keeping desktop audio stopped while mobile owns the session and preserving desktop connection intent and volume.\n- Remove the previous Dynamic FPS / MonkeyCraft window-minimize restriction and its compatibility notices.\n\n### Validation and download\n- 121 automated tests pass, along with formatting and build checks.\n- Use `imaginemorefun-3.4.3.jar`; the `-sources.jar` is for source inspection and is not the mod to install.\n- The release mod includes universal macOS (arm64 + x86_64) and Windows native helpers."
		},
